      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I am not Vingan; I am Vingan's spirit!... Zamindar sir! You are the one who believes in the soul—that soul has come.... The spirit of Vingan, who was burned and melted into a corpse in the hut you set ablaze!... It has come in ghostly form to show this demon... to the town!....",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vandikkaran-magan-en-s070-u005",
      "kind": "dialogue",
